OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor suspended for
OL,4,A'disrespectful' criticism of chief
OL,5,Aexecutive
OL,6,
OL,7,FA watchdog has suspended a long-serving
OL,8,FDumfries and Galloway independent
OL,9,Fcouncillor over "undermining and
OL,10,Fpersonal" comments about the local
OL,11,Fauthority's chief executive.
OL,13,FThe Standards Commission of Scotland
OL,14,F(SCS) concluded Andrew Wood's public
OL,15,Fcriticism of Dawn Roberts' involvement
OL,16,Fin the #2.6m purchase of new buses
OL,17,Funder delegated powers did not
OL,18,Fconstitute bullying and harassment.
OL,20,FHowever, it decided his actions had
OL,21,Fbeen "disrespectful" to someone with
OL,22,F"no public right of reply".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
