OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor suspended for
OL,4,A'disrespectful' criticism of chief
OL,5,Aexecutive
OL,6,
OL,7,FA panel said Wood's concerns could have
OL,8,Fbeen raised in private rather than in a
OL,9,Fnewspaper article and suspended him for
OL,10,Fone month.
